 Vince e la guerra inizia.","tagline":"C'è sempre un prezzo da pagare"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The Gamache, tailors from father to son, have been dressing the Mafia family Paternò for three generation. Vincent \"Vince\" Gamache works on behalf of Frank the godfather with his eldest son Giaco. Vince, reckless and rash, seeks to earn his stripes by impressing the godfather. Without the Paternò knowing, he stages a big operation and is promoted. Fuming with jealousy, Giaco discovers that Vince committed a monstrous act during his stroke. The Gamache disown Vince and war begins.","tagline":"There’s always a price to pay"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Les Gamache, tailleurs de père en fils, habillent la famille mafieuse Paternò depuis trois générations. Vince Gamache, téméraire et impétueux, monte un grand coup pour impressionner le parrain Frank Paternò, attisant la jalousie de son fils aîné Giaco. La guerre éclate. Tous doivent choisir leur camp. D’un côté comme de l’autre, il y a un prix à payer.","tagline":"Le pouvoir ne se partage pas"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9WLIwIQle63cbG6ohZetMNHHb9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rirjfrY6aZMq6HpXH4bBj9uL1jF.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":622469,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9WLIwIQle63cbG6ohZetMNHHb9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p9WLIwIQle63cbG6ohZetMNHHb9.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9WLIwIQle63cbG6ohZetMNHHb9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p9WLIwIQle63cbG6ohZetMNHHb9.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmd